# text, in link order = retail address order. One object per line:
#   build-sn/<NAME>.o <START> [gcc323]   <- src/<NAME>.c
# The optional compiler applies to the entire source object.
# Makefile.sn, rac1.ld.sh and the tools all read this file.
#
# text has no linker fill between objects. The file names and boundaries
# come from the NTSC split of this game, mapped to this PAL build by matching
# function sizes, and each checked against the PAL code (a return right
# before, a function start right at it); see docs/reference/DECOMP_PROGRESS.md.

